jcm-p2-hl emulator package

p2emu/model/paradis.py, advection.py, blocks.py and padding.py are derived from PARADIS
(original code by Stephane Gaudreault et al.), licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
These files were modified (2025-2026) for this application; the changes are not
