https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0.

p2emu/model/jcm_physics_p20bt.py and the QBO drag in p2emu/emulator.py port analytic terms
of JCM / jax-gcm (Apache License 2.0) to torch. fixer/ calls jcm-strat
(https://github.com/reflective-org/jcm-strat) and jax-gcm
(https://github.com/climate-analytics-lab/jax-gcm), both Apache License 2.0, installed
separately. fixer/hl_dyc_patch.py patches jcm-strat's QBO term at run time.

terrain_t63.nc (release asset) is bundles/t63/terrain.nc from the Hugging Face dataset
climate-analytics-lab/jax-gcm-data (revision 2ec867b), licensed CC-BY-4.0, unmodified.

